n ve kan ürünlerinin kullanılmalarında endikasyonda asami titialik","x0":0.20100605350115444,"x1":0.7805244189575291,"top":0.4022910258663728,"bottom":0.42083434100392625,"conf":1},{"text":"gösterilmelidir.","x0":0.16221766001232088,"x1":0.2956878839338511,"top":0.42587209288966,"bottom":0.43750000011283163,"conf":1},{"text":"a)Bu amaçla kan tranofüzyonu indikaeyonları konusunda eğitime önem veril-","x0":0.2009993445379575,"x1":0.8051584955898582,"top":0.4350030390100481,"bottom":0.4544310166779626,"conf":1},{"text":"melidir.","x0":0.15795093121249046,"x1":0.23013941814432476,"top":0.4588499323224571,"bottom":0.47283611392395697,"conf":0.5},{"text":"I-Du gokilde kon igrafı önlenecektir.","x0":0.203139338160846,"x1":0.5093398199769452,"top":0.47307428357058534,"bottom":0.487329501587381,"conf":1},{"text":"II-Menleketiniz gartlarında pekçok hastalığın (sitma, gifilie, gitomegalo-","x0":0.19280417555894608,"x1":0.805143329102439,"top":0.4852255469083484,"bottom":0.5061134548657678,"conf":0.5},{"text":"virus enfeksiyonu ve hepatit B, v.b.), bulagaaaı azalacaktir.","x0":0.16206472923574794,"x1":0.6572902596733236,"top":0.5050081030632833,"bottom":0.5236613923365372,"conf":1},{"text":"III-AIDS'in bulaçme olasiliği asalacaktir.","x0":0.18275154888714704,"x1":0.5338808985461178,"top":0.5230769234054733,"bottom":0.5377906973774221,"conf":1},{"text":"4-Kan tranafüzyonu ve bu meyanda bilhaosa AIDS konusunda da doktorlara-","x0":0.1988874836208297,"x1":0.7908098607770608,"top":0.5333163245928221,"bottom":0.5568261261477058,"conf":1},{"text":"mazin uyarılmasi yerinde olacaktir.","x0":0.16200299318886835,"x1":0.45194694195535295,"top":0.5572684908239143,"bottom":0.5729884474420033,"conf":1},{"text":"(.5..)","x0":0.4250513337329334,"x1":0.4763860377249721,"top":0.6235465118197377,"bottom":0.6366279067325878,"conf":0.5}]}